   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Evil Star**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Alter Me III**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Parking (On Chunky Shrapnel)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Superbug, Sense [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-live-in-brussels-19-show-1-audio** (recommended): source not stated; 16 songs; 44 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Performance occurred at the Ancienne Belgique in Brussels, Belgium, on October 8, 2019 [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-live-in-brussels-19-show-1-audio**: Tracks one through eight were recorded by the band's official sound crew; Tracks ten through twelve originate from The Bootleg Collection, Volume 1: Europe 2019 [1]",
